    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        MoReBench: Evaluating Procedural and Pluralistic Moral Reasoning in <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>, More than Outcomes
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
